Description: Reproducible analysis pipeline for cancer-specific prediction of
    molecular, immune, genomic instability and fusion endpoints from fixed pretrained
    TITAN, Giga-SSL and Prov-GigaPath whole-slide representations using PLS regression
    and PLS-LDA, with a matched downstream-probe comparison.
